    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stellar Archipelago is a third person base builder set in space. Collect resources and develop mini star systems. Place buildings to develop and increase the population of your system. Unlock new buildings by exploring planets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump between nearby differently shaped planets<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295680/extras/1f6c26482c6303aaa43a3f36e59f9142.avif?t=1754946942\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect resources to construct buildings<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295680/extras/1f3e11a0ea7d505a9a568afe18499afc.avif?t=1754946942\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new buildings as you explore<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295680/extras/c1e2f52925a9dbae7e4702e3b6c4eb8d.avif?t=1754946942\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural solar systems \u2013  develop new systems each time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295680/extras/a5df223b540128ddf014409a03749837.avif?t=1754946942\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stellar Archipelago is a third person base builder set in space. Collect resources and develop mini star systems. Place buildings to develop and increase the population of your system. Unlock new buildings by exploring planets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump between nearby differently shaped planets<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295680/extras/1f6c26482c6303aaa43a3f36e59f9142.avif?t=1754946942\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect resources to construct buildings<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295680/extras/1f3e11a0ea7d505a9a568afe18499afc.avif?t=1754946942\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new buildings as you explore<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295680/extras/c1e2f52925a9dbae7e4702e3b6c4eb8d.avif?t=1754946942\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural solar systems \u2013  develop new systems each time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295680/extras/a5df223b540128ddf014409a03749837.avif?t=1754946942\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
